WEBVTT

1
00:01:15.680 --> 00:01:16.840
song The pals see Glen.

2
00:01:20.822 --> 00:01:21.822
Glen is sad.

3
00:01:21.842 --> 00:01:26.043
Glen: I cannot find my clip.

4
00:01:27.084 --> 00:01:28.784
Yellow: We will find it!

5
00:01:31.765 --> 00:01:33.466
The pals look here and there.

6
00:01:36.087 --> 00:01:40.328
Red: It is not under the plate.

7
00:01:44.288 --> 00:01:46.449
Blue: It is not in the glass.

8
00:01:48.649 --> 00:01:51.550
Green: It is not by the plug.

9
00:01:59.952 --> 00:02:01.433
We can ask Pink!

10
00:02:04.434 --> 00:02:05.734
The pals see Pink.

11
00:02:06.554 --> 00:02:11.936
Glen: Please help us.

12
00:02:13.676 --> 00:02:16.038
Yellow: Glen cannot find his clip.

13
00:02:16.058 --> 00:02:17.499
Pink: Oh.

14
00:02:19.840 --> 00:02:21.021
I have your clip!

15
00:02:23.002 --> 00:02:23.643
Glen is glad.

16
00:02:23.683 --> 00:02:27.806
Yellow: I like your plane!

17
00:02:27.826 --> 00:02:32.449
Pink: My plane can fly!

18
00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:44.701
The pals clap.
